{
 "_doc": "Tier-3 pool building (random towns, commercial lots): a pawn shop and gun counter with a vault room and a basement range. Route: the grille is down and the front door bolted -> round the east side to the alley: the back door jemmied -> stair hall -> back hall (loose boards) -> Ray's office (the book) -> the staff door behind the counters: the looters on the showroom floor wake (ambush) -> down the stair to the basement range: Ray's body and the vault key on the bench (taking it wakes the range; cans strung in the doorway) -> back up to the vault door (Ray's shotgun rigged on it; an alarm in one dressing) -> the vault: Danny guards the guns -> out through the showroom, unbolting the front door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
